 ],
 "synopsis": "Ekkaa Electronics has filed its draft red herring prospectus with SEBI to raise Rs 725 crore through an initial public offering. The maiden public issue comprises a fresh issue of up to Rs 525 crore and an offer-for-sale worth Rs 200 crore by promoter Chandra Prakash Gupta and his wife, Madhuri Gupta. The Noida-headquartered consumer electronics manufacturer may also consider a pre-IPO placement of up to Rs 105 crore. Out of the net proceeds from the fresh issue, Rs 225 crore will be utilized for debt repayment, and Rs 150 crore will go toward working capital requirements. Motilal Oswal Investment Advisors and Shannon Advisors are managing the IPO.",
